Package: grafts
Title: Graph Forecasts for Time Series
Version: 0.0.0.9000
Authors@R: 
    person("Mitchell", "O'Hara-Wild", , "mail@mitchelloharawild.com", role = c("aut", "cre"),
           comment = c(ORCID = "0000-0001-6729-7695"))
Description: Interactive exploration of graph-temporal data, such as
    hierarchical and grouped time series, and their forecasts. The series
    graph and the graph of key combinations are drawn in a browser app,
    beside plots of the series reached and their forecasts from a fable.
